"site.help.glossary.ioGamesGlossary": "IO Games Glossary",
"site.help.glossary.termsEveryIoGame": "40+ terms every IO game player should know. From basic controls to advanced techniques — the complete dictionary for Agar.io, Slither.io, Expanding Land, and all cell games.",
"site.help.glossary.jumpToCategory": "Jump to Category",
"site.help.glossary.basics": "🎮 Basics",
